cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its evaluation protocol, please cite it."
title: "Personal Voice Clone Studio: collect, evaluate and fine-tune a personal voice"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-15"
repository-code: "TBD"
abstract: >
  A local-first workbench that records a phonetically balanced corpus of one speaker with
  automatic quality control, collects blind paired preferences over prosody instructions and
  model checkpoints (Bradley-Terry with bootstrap confidence intervals, repeat and anchor
  trials for rater reliability, objective WER and speaker-similarity metrics), and fine-tunes
  CosyVoice3 by speaker-adaptation SFT and preference optimization (DPO) on that data.
keywords:
  - text-to-speech
  - voice cloning
  - subjective evaluation
  - preference optimization
license: TBD
